@startuml
 title QR and guardian notification
participant "client QR" as Client
participant "ms-notification" as Notification
queue Kafka as KFK
participant "ms-user-management" as UM
participant "Expo Push" as Expo

Client -> Notification: POST /API/v1/notifications/scan
Notification -> KFK: publishes student.scanned
KFK -> Notification: Consumidor lee evento
Notification -> UM: queries guardians of the Student
UM --> Notification: Lista of guardians
Notification -> Expo: sends notification push
@enduml

